<title>PORTUGAL: Bank/Portugal drains funds at 6.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Bank/Portugal drains funds at 6.4 pct.</headline>
<text>
<p>LISBON, Dec 16 (Reuter) The Bank of Portugal said it drained 45.515 billion escudos from the money market at a fixed rate of 6.4 percent.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom 3511-3538254</p>
</text>
